  {
   "id": 3,
   "kind": "page",
   "heading": "充电规律",
   "narration": "解这个回路方程，得到充电规律。电荷随时间的变化是：q 等于 C epsilon 乘以括号一减 e 的负 t 比 RC 次方。t 等于零时，指数项为一，q 为零，符合初始条件。t 趋于无穷时，指数项趋于零，q 趋于 C epsilon，也就是充满。电流是 q 的导数：i 等于 epsilon 除以 R 乘 e 的负 t 比 RC 次方，指数衰减。注意 t 等于零时电流是最大值，之后单调下降——这与电荷的「先快后慢」正好呼应。",
   "elements": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "step": 0,
     "x": 170,
     "y": 137,
     "w": 1580,
     "h": 90,
     "align": "left",
     "valign": "center",
     "paras": [
      [
       {
        "t": "充电规律",
        "size": 48,
        "color": "#C00000",
        "b": true
       }
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "tex",
     "step": 1,
     "x": 170,
     "y": 244,
     "w": 1580,
     "h": 140,
     "tex": "q=C\\varepsilon\\left(1-\\mathrm e^{-t/RC}\\right)",
     "size": 36,
     "color": "#C00000",
     "align": "center",
     "hotspot": true,
     "label": "充电电荷公式",
     "qa": [
      {
       "q": "为什么电荷随时间是这样变化的？",
       "a": "由回路方程解得 $q=C\\varepsilon(1-\\mathrm e^{-t/RC})$，$t=0$ 时 $q=0$，$t\\to\\infty$ 时 $q\\to C\\varepsilon$。"
      }
     ],
     "important": true
    },
    {
     "type": "tex",
     "step": 2,
     "x": 170,
     "y": 410,
     "w": 1580,
     "h": 140,
     "tex": "i=\\dfrac{\\mathrm dq}{\\mathrm dt}=\\dfrac{\\varepsilon}{R}\\mathrm e^{-t/RC}",
     "size": 34,
     "color": "#0000CD",
     "align": "center",
     "hotspot": true,
     "label": "充电电流公式",
     "qa": [
